   "source": [
    "#Starting with a baseline 200km parking orbit, plot graph of saved DV versus number of refuels,\n",
    "#So, with a block3 starship, dry mass ~140 tons, isp ~380s, propellant load ~1600 tons, LEO payload 100T\n",
    "#assuming each tanker goes to HEO without refuels\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "prop_mass = 1600\n",
    "tanker_prop = 100\n",
    "dry_mass = 140\n",
    "isp=380\n",
    "DV_saved = np.linspace(0,1500,50)\n",
    "# p=DV_saved/(10*isp)\n",
    "Tanker_Final_Mass = (dry_mass+tanker_prop)*np.exp(-DV_saved/(9.81*isp))\n",
    "No_Refuels = prop_mass/(Tanker_Final_Mass - dry_mass)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.plot(No_Refuels,DV_saved)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"Number of Refuels\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"$\\Delta V$ Saved (m/s)\")\n",
    "plt.title(\"Block 3 Starship: Refuels vs Delta-V Saved naive refuel strategy\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ff452f99",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\\Delta V = g*isp*log(\\frac{m_w}{m_d})$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "625e8bf7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$m_w=m_dexp(\\frac{\\Delta V}{g*isp})$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
